  "name": "tiger",
  "_about": "THE REFERENCE SCULPT (2026-11-04, docs/engines.md 'the sculpt overlay'): the cat frame's rig, drawn by shapes written for a tiger -- long and low, a deep keel of a chest under heavy shoulder blades, massive forearms on big round paws, a lean loin with the loose belly skin under it, a high rump on thick thighs; a broad head that is mostly cheek, flared with a white ruff, short round ears black behind, a white-padded muzzle on a pink nose; the rig's own long tail kept. Stripes are the coat shader's (coatpat.js): along the body frame on the trunk, across each leg's own on the limbs, stacked on the brow",
  "use": "creatures/frames/cat",
